<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Delta Glass Q3 profit up sharply.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Delta Glass Q3 profit up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for Delta Glass to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Turnover		    922.8   vs 970.3</p>
<p> Profit before taxation  212.2   vs  91.8</p>
<p> Taxation		     63.6   vs  27.5</p>
<p> Profit after taxation   148.5   vs  64.2</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
